%h1 Product outcomes
%p.text-muted Last 30 days. Counts start when tracking was enabled; historical actions are not backfilled. Impressions record recommendations rendered on the dashboard, not proof someone read them.
.card.mb-4
  .card-body
    .table-responsive
      %table.table
        %thead
          %tr
            %th Action
            %th Events
            %th Members
        %tbody
          - ProductEvent::NAMES.each do |name|
            %tr
              %th= name.humanize
              %td= metrics[:events].fetch(name, 0)
              %td= metrics[:members].fetch(name, 0)
.card.mb-4
  .card-body
    %h2.h5 Recommendation outcomes
    %p These actions followed a recommendation for the same member and job within 30 days. This shows an association, not proof that the recommendation caused the outcome.
    %p= "Applications: #{metrics[:recommended_applications]}"
    %p= "Confirmed bookings: #{metrics[:recommended_bookings]}"
    %h3.h6 Reasons people hide recommendations
    - if metrics[:dismissal_reasons].empty?
      %p.text-muted No feedback yet.
    - metrics[:dismissal_reasons].each do |reason, count|
      %p= "#{RecommendationFeedback::REASONS.fetch(reason)}: #{count}"
